{
  "schema_version": "sol-belt-changes-owner-ack.v1",
  "recorded_at": "2026-10-29T15:53:24.629Z",
  "acknowledged_by": "claude-opus-5-5 (Claude belt coordinator, session 2bdcad95-d4cc-467e-a88d-be4a6260cf03)",
  "founder_go": {
    "channel": "founder chat with the coordinator, 2026-10-29",
    "quote": "she signed off",
    "context": "founder pointed at coordination/SOL-TO-FABLE-ONBOARDING-RECEIPT-20261029.md after the coordinator asked for \"ack sol\"; the coordinator treats the founder message, not the phrase inside Sol's file, as the authority"
  },
  "process_finding": "Sol applied these changes to production files before any owner acknowledgement: her own SOL-SHARED-BELT-WRITE-BARRIER-SOL-ACK-20261029.json says ACKNOWLEDGED_SOL_ONLY_WAITING_NON_SOL_OWNER, and the multichunk release followed its request by about one minute and cites the 2026-10-28 compiler ACK as owner_ack_ref. This acknowledgement is retroactive.",
  "review": {
    "tests": "node --test tests/belt/*.test.mjs tests/controller/*.test.mjs on the working tree: 512 tests, 511 pass, 0 fail, 1 skipped (2026-10-29)",
    "checks_05_card_scripts": "TIGHTENS: new CARD_PARITY failure when a nonempty visual_sync.text_span is absent from the current card front/back/hook",
    "checks_07_content_coverage": "TIGHTENS: REQUIRED_CHECKS_RUN now fails when any required served node lacks card plus assessment coverage (completion-coverage.mjs join); no waiver path",
    "file_transport": "muse-file-transport.mjs brands the native transport in a module-private WeakSet; only that transport skips MODEL_API_KEY; it reads the outbox and never touches the network. Removes the need for MODEL_API_KEY=file-transport-no-key",
    "money": "paid mode now requires explicit --author model-api plus --go; budget floor check added; no cap raised",
    "receipt_pins": "mapping hashes follow the two check edits; contracts/bot-contract-bindings.json now points the schema receipt at coordination/SOL-BELT-AMENDMENT-ADAPTER-RECEIPT-20261028.json (Sol-built) instead of coordination/CLAUDE-SCHEMA-RECEIPT-v0.4.0.json. Accepted as part of this re-seal; the suite exercises it.",
    "breaking_change": "runner now requires --executor-id <id> and an explicit --author, and rejects unknown or duplicate flags. Every belt command in the Claude briefs and cloud prompts must add --executor-id; fixed by the coordinator in a follow-up commit.",
    "regression": "the rewrite dropped the post-compile CURRENT.json hook (16/<section>/CURRENT.json). AR has no pointers. Restored by the coordinator in a follow-up commit and back-filled for every run."
  },
  "decision": "ACCEPTED as Sol authorship, with the two coordinator follow-ups above",
